        <mxCell id="xlvQpP4VGtnAMPnG3-UR-1" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="Agent Runtime&amp;nbsp;&lt;div&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Agent Runtime is the execution engine of your platform&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Job:&lt;br&gt;Take a validated Agent Definition and execute it according to the graph described in that definition.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="150" width="490" x="80" y="70" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b5HtyTRRGL35-U57Frr2-1" parent="1" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=light-dark(#FFFFFF,#000000);html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=middle;overflow=hidden;fontColor=light-dark(#000000,#00FF00);align=left;" value="&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot;&gt;It is &lt;strong&gt;not the Builder Agent&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(0, 255, 0));&quot;&gt;It does not decide what agent the user wants.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(0, 255, 0));&quot;&gt;It does not design agents.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(0, 255, 0));&quot;&gt;It does not generate configurations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(0, 255, 0));&quot;&gt;It does not talk to the user about building an agent.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(0, 255, 0));&quot;&gt;It executes agents that have already been built.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="223.02" width="320" x="580" y="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
